				},
				{
					"id": 40090703,
					"content": "嗚哇…一道接一道升上去了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						40090704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 40090704,
					"content": "房間中央那是什麼？",
